  Parameters: {"utf8"=>"✓", "authenticity_token"=>"94QUi9IBZJaidLU50lj7HGSuyOIjL68RdpfW0Z0IpjI=", "issue"=>{"is_private"=>"0", "project_id"=>"46", "tracker_id"=>"4", "subject"=>"Nap Site l Allbet l Betting Limit 250 - 25,000 (Indo Currency only) No tick", "description"=>"<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>I. Incident&nbsp;summary</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><em>[Capped at 250 words]</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Allbet product &gt; missed mapping&nbsp;betting limit 250 - 25,000 for Super level (Indo currency only).</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>II. Incident Details</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>CSD found new created Super User MY &gt; Allbet &gt; betting limit 250 - 25,000 no tick and this user is copy from user MQ also no tick.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8:18pm, Informed Skype (CSD contacts Starix Channel) to check.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8:27pm, Kiwi informed &gt; refer to Live Baccarat Game Setting there are 4 stake levels 25-3,000; 75-7,500; 250-10,000; 750-30,000</p>\r\n\r\n<p>[8:35:50 PM] Starix IT-Kiwi: you can see that the rule to map between SLI LC and Allbet&nbsp;&gt; row 30 &amp; 31 (please refer to attached file)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SLI &nbsp; &nbsp;=&gt; &nbsp; Allbet<br />\r\n25-3,000 =&gt; 40-4,000<br />\r\n75-7,500 =&gt; 100-10,000<br />\r\n250-10,000 =&gt; 100-10,000<br />\r\n750-30,000 =&gt; 300-30,000</p>\r\n\r\n<p>[8:37:14 PM] Starix IT-Kiwi: 250-10,000 =&gt; 100-10,000 while copying from LC to AB beside this, we leave 250-10,000 of AB un-ticked it means that we didn&#39;t consider what we should deal with 250-10,000 at the launching time that&#39;s why there is no Super offered 250-10,000 for ALLBET at the launching time except these supers HID, RGIDO, AGD, ZA, RG2DO, MY. it seems that these supers were adjusted manually by csd</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Peter (Allbet PIC) will check with Celine for this issue.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>PENDING KIWI FURTHER UPDATE</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>III. Chronological Order of Events</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:500px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Date &amp; Time (GMT+8)</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Description &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 2016&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>CSD found&nbsp;new created Super MY (Indo currency) &gt; Allbet &gt; betting limit 250 - 25,000 no tick and this user is copy from user MQ also no tick.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>15 Nov 2016 &amp; 8:18pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Informed Skype (CSD contacts Starix Channel) to check.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 2016 &amp; 8:27pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>Kiwi informed they&nbsp;copy setting to Allbet &gt;&nbsp;make 75 - 7,500 &amp; 250 - 10,000 become the same 100 - 10,000&nbsp;there was NO mapping from LC to Allbet for 250 - 25,000&nbsp;that&#39;s why at Super level, this 250 - 25,000 is un-ticked.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 2016 &amp; 8:52pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Peter will check with Celine for this issue.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">16 Nov 2016 3 PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Peter checked with Celine and Erica to apply all missing ranges for Super and Direct Master and Direct Agent. VN DBA is preparing script to update data for this. This rule will be applied for next batches launching also. We will run the script around 11 AM GMT + 8 on 17 Nov 2016</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">17 Nov 2016 11 AM GMT + 8</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>VN DBA run script to apply all missing ranges for Supers &amp; Direct Masters, Direct Agents</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "status_id"=>"5", "priority_id"=>"3", "assigned_to_id"=>"124", "start_date"=>"2016-11-15", "due_date"=>"2016-11-17", "custom_field_values"=>{"8"=>["Allbet", ""], "3"=>["Credit-Alpha", "Credit-ExtNAP", "NAP-Accounting", ""], "23"=>["All", ""], "4"=>["Configuration", ""], "19"=>"N/A", "15"=>"MY", "7"=>"didn't consider how to configure for stake level range 250-25,000", "17"=>"We will apply the rule to enable all bet setting ranges we have for All Supers/Direct Masters/Direct Agents when we run initial data each time we launch the product for each batch.", "16"=>"We will apply the rule to enable all bet setting ranges we have for All Supers/Direct Masters/Direct Agents for Indo/Thai/Won market"}, "notes"=>"", "private_notes"=>"0", "lock_version"=>"5"}, "issue_template"=>"", "last_journal_id"=>"334", "id"=>"102", "project_id"=>"allbet"}
