Processing by IssuesController#update as HTML
  Parameters: {"utf8"=>"✓", "authenticity_token"=>"iiFIxIf0O9STDbx1lX1CqLibrgKzbH3D+yibaszF69o=", "issue"=>{"is_private"=>"0", "project_id"=>"28", "tracker_id"=>"4", "subject"=>"Mobile | LIVV88 | Changes of Handicap Market", "description"=>"<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>I. Incident&nbsp;summary&nbsp;</strong></span><em>[Capped at 250 words]</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Customer claimed Handicap market is different at Waiting status and Running status.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Acknowledged by Ms Erica.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>II. Incident Details</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>CS_Rossi feedback they have a customer betting at Mobile platform, the Handicap market display in Waiting status and Running status is different. Rossi would like to know is this a normal behavior.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>From the screenshot, when ticket under &quot;Waiting&quot; status, it shows market bet on Tianjin Gold Lions 30.5; When find it at Statement, ticket has updated as Running status but the market is Tianjin Gold Lions 29.5.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ref No: 101142929634<br />\r\n11/16/2016 8:08:13 AM<br />\r\nTianjin Gold Lions 29.5 [0-0]<br />\r\nHandicap<br />\r\nZhejiang Guangsha Lions &nbsp;- vs - Tianjin Gold Lions<br />\r\nBasketball China CBA</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>III. Chronological Order of Events</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:500px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Date &amp; Time (GMT+8)</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Description &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">17 NOV 4:43PM,</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>LIVV88 CS feedback the issue at Skype.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">17 NOV 5:08PM,</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Escalated the issue to&nbsp;CSD_NewMobile Issue (Licensee) group.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">17 NOV 5:16PM,</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>TW PM_Jackal assisted on checking the issue. &nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n", "status_id"=>"2", "priority_id"=>"2", "assigned_to_id"=>"56", "start_date"=>"2016-11-17", "due_date"=>"", "custom_field_values"=>{"21"=>["LIVV88 (KEENOCEAN)", ""], "8"=>["Sportsbook", ""], "3"=>["Licensee-Frontend", ""], "24"=>["Smart", ""], "4"=>["Others", ""], "19"=>"N/A", "15"=>"KeenOceanRMB015650", "7"=>"N/A", "17"=>"", "16"=>""}, "notes"=>"<p>Hi Jackal,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This case similar as below :-</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Subject:New Mobile Site l Ticket Market Change After Confirm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Date: 2016-10-11 22:26</p>\r\n\r\n<p>From: supp0rt.csd.1@enpine.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To: jackal.chien@onelab.tw</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dear Jackal,</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe received Member claimed he used mobile to place bet and found his ticket market changed after confirm by system from &quot;<strong>Under 3</strong>&quot; to &quot;<strong>Under 2.75</strong>&quot; when he check from &quot;RUNNING&quot; &gt; &quot;TODAY&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMember User: <strong>DDBSB77002</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nRef No: 100947162497<br />\r\n10/11/2016 5:24:00 AM<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\nUnder 2.75 [0-1]<br />\r\nOver/Under<br />\r\nAustralia - vs - Japan<br />\r\nSoccer 2018 FIFA WORLD CUP ASIA QUALIFIERS<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDomain: m.maxbet.com<br />\r\nMarket change from Under 3 odds -0.83 to Under 2.75 odds -0.83.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs we check this match we did offered Under 3 odds -0.83 is around 5:17pm, but member ticket placed in is 5:24pm.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe also test our end after click on &quot;<strong>Bet</strong>&quot; means ticket is already accepted by system, so just wonder how come Member ticket market changed later on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please see the attahed file.</p>\r\n", "private_notes"=>"0", "lock_version"=>"1"}, "issue_template"=>"", "attachments"=>{"1"=>{"filename"=>"DDBSB77002 Over Under 3.jpg", "description"=>"", "token"=>"55.7819dd85a4b3b33f7f3b73e3018d7980"}, "2"=>{"filename"=>"DDBSB77002 ticket show betting time.jpg", "description"=>"", "token"=>"56.ccd1eabc32926926cfebddb40b51f718"}}, "last_journal_id"=>"347", "commit"=>"Submit", "id"=>"107"}
